    ref.read(glassesMediaControllerProvider);

    return DeviceAutoConnectGate(
```

另有 `authBootstrapProvider`（恢复登录态，FutureProvider）：

```23:39:packages/feature/account/feature_account_auth/lib/src/service/auth_providers.dart
final authBootstrapProvider = FutureProvider<AuthSession?>((ref) async {
  final service = ref.watch(authServiceProvider);
  final session = await service.restoreSession();
  // ...
  return session;
