```

`appLlmControllerProvider` 自身注释也要求根级 eager init：

```773:777:packages/feature/ai/feature_app_llm/lib/src/controller/app_llm_controller.dart
/// AutoDispose: torn down when the page is popped, stopping mic + socket + audio.
// 非 autoDispose：controller 常驻，确保 BLE 唤醒事件在任意页面都能收到。
// 需在 App 根级别 eager 初始化（ref.read(appLlmControllerProvider)）。
final appLlmControllerProvider =
    NotifierProvider<AppLlmController, AppLlmState>(AppLlmController.new);
```

**结论：** 若要「尽早 + 与 BLE 无关 + fire-and-forget + 能用 Riverpod factory」，最佳既有模式是 **`_GlassesRootState`（`app.dart`）**，而不是 `main()`（尚无 `ProviderScope`）。`main()` 里只能直接 `new DefaultInterpretationAudioEngine(...)`，会绕过 provider override。

